{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Fragments.V</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"tcpip","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Fragments","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"V","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = int64 * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Cstruct</span>.t * bool * int * <span><span>(int * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Cstruct</span>.t)</span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The type of values in the fragment cache: a timestamp of the first received one, IP options (of the first fragment), whether or not the last fragment was received (the one with more fragments cleared), amount of received fragments, and a list of pairs of offset and fragment.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-weight\"><a href=\"#val-weight\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> weight : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>weight t</code> is the data length of the received fragments.</p></div></div>"}